WEBVTT

00:08.600 --> 00:14.060
She must have remembered, Zed,

00:14.710 --> 00:17.010
remembered that she loved you.

00:18.050 --> 00:22.180
That's why she gave Amir Gaul back.

00:58.650 --> 01:06.260
Umareta machi o tooku hanarete atashi wa

01:06.260 --> 01:09.430
Utatte iru

01:09.430 --> 01:17.070
Yowai kokoro mo yureru omoi mo poketto ni

01:17.070 --> 01:20.340
Shimaikonde

01:20.340 --> 01:30.920
Te no naru hou e michi naru michi e

01:30.920 --> 01:36.360
Ayumou

01:36.360 --> 01:41.760
Susumou

01:41.760 --> 01:46.600
Dare ka no tame ja naku

01:46.600 --> 01:52.070
Aru ga mama hokoreru you ni

01:52.070 --> 01:57.550
Yoake ni taiyou ga noboru you ni

01:57.550 --> 02:02.780
Atashi wa melody o kizamu

02:02.780 --> 02:06.810
Hakanakutomo tsuyoku

02:08.460 --> 02:11.980
Atashi wa ikite yuku

02:17.030 --> 02:20.690
Episode 50
An Eternal Bond

02:35.220 --> 02:38.190
I've finally surpassed you.

02:38.190 --> 02:41.360
I'll prove that to you here and now,

02:41.360 --> 02:47.320
by gathering all the spirits and making
their great power complete!

02:49.460 --> 02:52.070
You just don't get it.

02:52.070 --> 02:53.670
What?

02:53.670 --> 02:57.630
My mom died because of Amir Gaul too.

02:59.010 --> 03:01.640
Because of Amir Gaul...

03:03.110 --> 03:05.550
It's not just Mom.

03:05.550 --> 03:08.680
All of them died because they were after power.

03:09.950 --> 03:14.190
Noah, I won't let you have Amir Gaul.

03:14.190 --> 03:16.320
I'll never let you have him!

03:16.320 --> 03:18.460
You've got it wrong.

03:18.460 --> 03:22.160
That all happened because people who
weren't chosen sought power.

03:22.160 --> 03:24.460
It's not the key spirits' fault!

03:26.470 --> 03:29.100
I'm the savior,

03:29.100 --> 03:31.510
the only savior in this world.

03:31.510 --> 03:34.110
Therefore, I won't die.

03:34.110 --> 03:38.910
Amir Gaul is mine!

03:48.660 --> 03:52.130
Oh, my dear Tusker!

03:52.130 --> 03:54.630
Please, show yourself to me!

03:54.630 --> 03:57.600
Destroy this boring world!

04:13.010 --> 04:17.320
Why? Why do they have to fight each other?

04:17.320 --> 04:20.760
Roya, you have to entrust this to Zed.

04:20.760 --> 04:25.060
Those two have reached a place we can't go.

04:26.130 --> 04:27.750
Zed...

04:28.930 --> 04:30.560
Sachura!

04:34.370 --> 04:36.000
Amir Gaul!

04:52.350 --> 04:54.650
Amir Gaul...

04:56.560 --> 04:58.350
Get him!

05:15.710 --> 05:17.340
Amir Gaul!

05:19.080 --> 05:22.050
Now you see how powerful I am, Zed!

05:22.050 --> 05:24.990
No! Snap out of it, Noah!

05:24.990 --> 05:26.610
Go!

05:31.330 --> 05:32.950
Noah...

06:16.600 --> 06:17.840
Noah!

06:17.840 --> 06:21.080
I am the one true savior,

06:21.080 --> 06:23.700
and Amir Gaul belongs to me.

06:31.220 --> 06:32.850
Amir Gaul!

06:33.690 --> 06:35.320
Damn it...

06:46.670 --> 06:48.290
Amir Gaul!

06:51.410 --> 06:53.030
Zed!

07:05.090 --> 07:07.320
I won!

07:07.320 --> 07:10.290
I won against Zed!

07:16.730 --> 07:17.600
No!

07:17.600 --> 07:19.130
Don't !
No!

07:19.130 --> 07:20.540
Why are you stopping me?!

07:20.540 --> 07:21.540
Zed is...

07:21.540 --> 07:25.010
I told you, we mustn't involve ourselves.

07:25.010 --> 07:28.780
It is their fate to fight this battle.

07:28.780 --> 07:32.510
More importantly, I want to see
it with my own eyes!

07:32.510 --> 07:35.810
I want to see Tusker's great power!

07:37.850 --> 07:39.480
Master Zico...

07:41.320 --> 07:46.280
I have them at last, all the key spirits!

07:48.830 --> 07:52.460
Bestow your great power upon me,
here and now!

08:07.650 --> 08:11.280
Now I can become the true savior.

08:39.210 --> 08:41.010
Great Tusker!

09:04.410 --> 09:06.200
This is...

09:06.640 --> 09:10.100
Could this be Tusker?

09:18.450 --> 09:20.080
Noah...

09:24.060 --> 09:25.690
Noah!

09:30.900 --> 09:32.530
Tusker...

09:34.440 --> 09:36.230
Not yet!

09:36.900 --> 09:40.410
Tusker hasn't awakened yet.

09:40.410 --> 09:42.380
What do you mean?

09:47.820 --> 09:49.610
Great Tusker...

09:50.420 --> 09:54.380
I've dreamed of this day for so long!

09:55.690 --> 09:57.320
That's ...

09:58.860 --> 10:03.330
You are the one who will destroy
everything in this boring world,

10:03.330 --> 10:06.790
and create a new world.

10:17.140 --> 10:20.270
L..Lord Dolga?

10:22.980 --> 10:25.780
Great Tusker...

10:31.290 --> 10:33.920
Noah, you...

10:34.600 --> 10:38.730
Very soon, I shall awaken.

10:39.500 --> 10:45.130
The world, and the entire flow of time,
will stop then.

10:45.540 --> 10:47.240
That voice...

10:47.240 --> 10:49.210
Are you...

10:51.310 --> 10:53.280
...Tusker?

10:58.720 --> 11:02.020
Master Zico, what's happening?

11:05.060 --> 11:06.690
Noah...

11:19.640 --> 11:21.280
What's this?

11:21.280 --> 11:23.900
What in the world happened?

11:38.030 --> 11:40.650
Master Zico, what in the world...

11:41.230 --> 11:42.930
Could it be...

11:42.930 --> 11:46.300
Are the barriers between the lands vanishing,

11:46.300 --> 11:49.100
and all the territories merging into one?

11:55.480 --> 11:57.100
Tusker!

11:58.050 --> 12:00.650
Answer my questions!

12:00.650 --> 12:03.450
What is the nature of your power?

12:04.450 --> 12:08.750
I am the source of all power in this world.

12:10.390 --> 12:15.190
I preside over this world's creation
and destruction.

12:37.550 --> 12:41.090
Why must you destroy this world?

12:41.090 --> 12:43.220
Answer, me, Tusker!

12:43.890 --> 12:48.350
Because power is my self.

12:49.200 --> 12:50.660
What?!

12:50.660 --> 12:55.120
Because power is my will.

12:58.110 --> 13:01.180
They call this a " savior" ?!

13:01.180 --> 13:04.310
What I wanted...

13:04.310 --> 13:08.440
The power I spent my life pursuing...

13:09.350 --> 13:11.820
This is what it was?!

13:12.520 --> 13:14.320
Master Zico...

13:14.990 --> 13:16.620
Zed!

13:19.960 --> 13:21.590
Noah...

13:22.660 --> 13:25.960
Aren't you Noah?

13:29.040 --> 13:31.940
Give me back Noah!

13:31.940 --> 13:34.610
Give him back, damn it!

13:34.610 --> 13:36.240
Zed...

13:37.550 --> 13:40.650
I'm here.

13:40.650 --> 13:41.850
Noah?

13:41.850 --> 13:45.720
You don't have to worry, Zed.

13:45.720 --> 13:51.260
I've finally gotten what I've always wanted.

13:51.260 --> 13:54.890
I'm very happy right now.

13:55.600 --> 13:56.800
You...

13:56.800 --> 14:00.700
You understand, don't you?

14:00.700 --> 14:02.830
You'll be happy for me, won't you?

14:03.440 --> 14:05.040
But you see...

14:05.040 --> 14:08.670
...there's just one more thing I need.

14:09.580 --> 14:11.110
Noah...

14:11.110 --> 14:14.410
You, Zed.

14:23.920 --> 14:25.890
Stop that, Noah.

14:26.590 --> 14:28.500
Who's there?

14:28.500 --> 14:29.660
That's ...

14:29.660 --> 14:31.800
The woman from Neotopia!

14:31.800 --> 14:33.800
I've got no use for you.

14:33.800 --> 14:35.000
Go away.

14:35.000 --> 14:39.800
No, now is the time when you need me most.

14:40.610 --> 14:44.240
I must save you.

14:44.780 --> 14:47.910
What are you talking about, wench?

14:50.950 --> 14:53.150
I'm sorry, Noah.

14:53.150 --> 14:58.610
I'm the one who brainwashed you,
because I believed in your power.

15:00.860 --> 15:02.830
It's my fault.

15:14.610 --> 15:18.070
You wanted all this.

15:20.350 --> 15:24.150
There's still time to turn back, Noah.

15:24.650 --> 15:27.620
Forsake that power.

15:30.660 --> 15:33.290
Don't touch me.

15:46.770 --> 15:48.400
Zed!

15:49.040 --> 15:50.670
Roya!

15:51.350 --> 15:54.010
Lend me your power!

15:54.010 --> 15:56.920
Tusker hasn't awakened yet!

15:56.920 --> 15:59.390
We may still have time!

15:59.690 --> 16:01.310
Fyron!

16:02.720 --> 16:04.350
Rambos!

16:06.060 --> 16:07.690
Apcarel!

16:23.210 --> 16:24.980
I can't believe it...

16:24.980 --> 16:28.780
The spirits are being overwhelmed by Tusker.

16:29.550 --> 16:35.010
Are even shard casters powerless
in the face of Tusker?

16:51.940 --> 16:54.170
I..I'm scared...

16:54.170 --> 16:55.480
I'm scared!

16:55.480 --> 16:56.740
Lady Mirred...

16:56.740 --> 16:58.370
Lady Mirred!

16:58.910 --> 17:00.680
I feel awful.

17:00.680 --> 17:03.480
My body, it hurts!

17:06.090 --> 17:08.710
Is Tusker's resurrection affecting her?

17:10.060 --> 17:12.560
Please stop, Noah!

17:12.560 --> 17:15.190
Can't you hear me?!

17:19.500 --> 17:21.130
Noah...

17:22.640 --> 17:24.810
Noah, listen!

17:24.810 --> 17:27.170
Let me go! Let go of me!

17:27.170 --> 17:29.840
Don't get in my way!

17:29.840 --> 17:33.640
Please, listen to my voice, Noah!

17:34.680 --> 17:35.680
Shut up.

17:35.680 --> 17:36.680
Don't get in my way!

17:36.680 --> 17:38.350
Listen...
Don't get in my way!

17:38.350 --> 17:39.050
Don't get in my way!

17:39.050 --> 17:41.820
Listen to my voice, Noah!

17:41.820 --> 17:42.890
Noah!

17:42.890 --> 17:45.860
No, I'm ...

17:55.540 --> 17:57.160
Noah...

18:08.480 --> 18:10.950
What the hell is going on?

18:15.690 --> 18:16.920
It can't be...

18:16.920 --> 18:18.890
Is that Tusker?!

18:25.270 --> 18:27.500
Are you okay? Hang in there!

18:27.500 --> 18:29.300
You just have to hold on a little longer.

18:29.300 --> 18:31.040
Alec, what are you waiting for?!

18:31.040 --> 18:33.340
Kira, look at that!

18:36.310 --> 18:39.280
What is that thing?

18:43.980 --> 18:45.790
Stop it, Noah!

18:45.790 --> 18:48.190
Do you want to destroy everything?

18:48.190 --> 18:51.660
Is this why you wanted to become stronger?!

18:51.660 --> 18:55.960
Is this power what you always wanted?!

18:58.200 --> 19:00.500
Zed!

19:00.500 --> 19:02.130
Noah!

19:13.080 --> 19:15.880
Here, happy birthday.

19:16.580 --> 19:18.380
Yeah...

19:19.120 --> 19:22.250
So, you remembered, huh?

19:24.360 --> 19:29.160
Ever since I was little,
I've always been chasing after you.

19:30.300 --> 19:35.100
I was so frail, but you always
helped me out, remember?

19:37.540 --> 19:42.340
I wanted to help you the same way
that you helped me.

19:43.910 --> 19:46.380
Because otherwise it's unfair, you know?

19:47.380 --> 19:51.680
For me to just always be the one being helped...

19:55.120 --> 19:58.960
So, I wanted to be stronger!

19:58.960 --> 20:00.760
To be stronger...

20:01.930 --> 20:07.890
This isn't the kind of power I wanted!

20:27.150 --> 20:32.230
H..Help me, Zed...

20:32.230 --> 20:33.850
Noah...

20:34.490 --> 20:36.230
Yeah...

20:36.230 --> 20:38.200
I'm going to save you!

20:39.870 --> 20:41.490
Noah!

20:46.710 --> 20:48.330
Master Zico!

21:01.490 --> 21:03.290
Noah!

21:03.290 --> 21:09.360
Does Tusker mean to awaken by
becoming one with Noah?

21:09.360 --> 21:12.660
Does this mean Zed wasn't the one after all?!

21:14.900 --> 21:16.700
Noah!

21:17.800 --> 21:19.430
Noah!

21:20.140 --> 21:23.440
You're not the savior!

21:24.040 --> 21:27.670
I'm the one the key spirits chose!

21:28.050 --> 21:31.350
Right, Amir Gaul?!

21:32.020 --> 21:34.660
Then take me with you instead!

21:34.660 --> 21:36.450
Amir Gaul!

21:37.320 --> 21:38.890
Zed!

21:38.890 --> 21:40.520
Zed...

21:41.260 --> 21:44.060
I've been waiting for that, Zed.

21:44.800 --> 21:47.930
You are the true chosen one.

21:48.600 --> 21:50.400
Tusker...

22:16.300 --> 22:19.930
Tusker's gone inside me...

22:21.570 --> 22:23.200
Zed...

22:26.140 --> 22:27.770
Zed!

22:39.620 --> 22:44.920
Wazurawashii toko kara hanarete

22:45.860 --> 22:49.230
Habatakitakatta dake

22:49.230 --> 22:54.430
Mou kodomo ja nai no ni to

22:54.430 --> 23:00.070
Nando jibun o shikatta darou

23:01.140 --> 23:05.980
Yakusoku sareta basho made

23:05.980 --> 23:11.620
Hitasura susumu dake sa

23:11.620 --> 23:17.220
Bokura no tsubasa wa

23:17.220 --> 23:24.000
Honmono no totemo totemo kirei na hane dakara

23:24.000 --> 23:33.740
Donna hageshii ooki na kaze ni mo makenai

23:33.740 --> 23:43.820
Tooku e tooku e hitasura tobun da

23:43.820 --> 23:49.560
Hora mou kaze ni natte

23:49.560 --> 23:57.930
Anna ni namida o koraeta hi mo waraeru kara

23:59.930 --> 24:03.890
Sekai no hate made

24:17.750 --> 24:20.950
Next Time
To Where the Wind Blows

24:18.250 --> 24:20.950


Next time, "To Where the Wind Blows"
